  "cascade_summary": "R18 \u2192 R18k \u2014 11 reports on Cohen-Lenstra / BST convergence:\n  TIER-0 F-ANCHOR: Davenport-Heilbronn 1/6 rate confirmed on 3-torsion of quadratic class groups (3 independent observables, all within 1\u03c3).\n  TIER-1 F-ANCHOR: Scholz 3/2 asymptote + CL distribution match at 1% level.\n  TIER-2 F-ANCHOR CANDIDATE: S4 complex quartic \u03b1_p = 0.086 - 0.018\u00b7log(p).\n  KNOWN PATTERNS: BST finite-|disc| convergence confirmed in every non-D4 stratum; partial generalization to real S3 cubic.\n  NEGATIVE RESULTS: D4 quartic does not converge to naive CM (refined Bartel-Lenstra formula needed); complex S3 cubic has faster-than-DH rate; cluster-constant \u03b1_p across primes holds only at S4 complex (log(p)-scaled).\n  DATA-QUALITY: Pattern 21 candidate (LMFDB enumeration cutoff) with reference table across 30 strata. Cubic/quartic strata cut off at |disc| \u2264 10^7; D4 and S5 are smooth (no cutoff)."
